title: Skyscraper
text: The lift only stops where you get out. A splitter lets the light step off at a floor and ride on up at the same time.
trick: teleporter lift; splitters in the lift's gaps serve two floors and keep the beam rising; dopplers colour each floor
motif: skyscraper with a lift shaft
ink: 2.5
expect: recolours>=3, shared>=3
